    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Roguish Archetype (Unearthed Arcana)</em></p><p>You’ve had a soul-shaking realization: you have died before, and yet you are alive again. This life isn’t your first, and it might not even be your second. Your past life, or lives, remain unclear to you, but you know that you passed through the gates of death, and that the powers of death, or some other influence, weren’t done with you. Perhaps you convinced a deity to let you return to the Material Plane, signed a deal with a fiend, or were revived by an artifact. Whatever force brought you back, you now know the truth about yourself: you are one of death’s representatives among the living.</p>",
